Engineering references
----------------------

`marcelroed/gigatoken` (Rust) was consulted as an engineering reference
for BPE semantics, the GPT-2 byte-level alphabet, and pretokenizer
behaviour, frozen at upstream commit

    fac0114b37120ec8a76362e9ee8e1c742aaafaef

No Rust source from that project is vendored into this distribution. The
C implementation is independent. Where the two disagree, the divergence
is recorded in `evidence/validation.md` and `PHASE7_FINDINGS.md` rather
than resolved by copying. See `AUDIT_PHASE1-4_PROVENANCE_ENVIRONMENT.md`
for the file-level provenance comparison.

The GPT-2 pretokenizer regular expression and the GPT-2 byte-to-unicode
mapping are specifications from OpenAI. They are implemented here from
their published behaviour. OpenAI is not a party to this project.